<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-BUGNO WINS 20TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BUGNO WINS 20TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SEGOVIA, Spain 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gianni Bugno of Italy won the 20th stage of the Tour of Spain over 204 kms betwen Avila and Segovia on Friday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
